Url", "founders.Ki-Lok Wong.location", "founders.Ki-Lok Wong.website"]}, "hqCountry": "Singapore", "crunchbase": "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/airwallex", "subSectors": ["Cross-border payments", "Business accounts / banking", "Corporate cards", "Spend management", "Embedded finance", "Treasury / FX", "Payments infrastructure / API"], "exitDetails": null, "foundedYear": 2015, "statusGroup": "active", "totalRaised": "~$1.58B", "fundingStage": "Series G (Growth / late-stage)", "snappedSector": "Fintech", "matchedCompany": "Airwallex (Airwallex Pty Ltd) — global fintech founded in Melbourne, Australia, 2015", "totalRaisedUsd": 1580000000, "longDescription": "Airwallex is a global financial technology company that provides businesses with multi-currency accounts, cross-border payments, corporate cards, spend management, treasury, and embedded finance products through its API and proprietary financial infrastructure. Founded in Melbourne, Australia in 2015 and now dual-headquartered in Singapore and San Francisco, it serves over 150,000-200,000 businesses globally and operates across roughly 200 countries. In October 2025 the company surpassed US$1 billion in annualized revenue (up ~90% YoY) and more than US$235 billion in annualized transaction volume. It was one of Australia's earliest tech unicorns and is backed by Blackbird Ventures."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
