tomer experience (CX) software platform that helps service businesses collect real-time customer feedback using the Net Promoter Score (NPS) framework and turn it into action for frontline teams. The platform connects employee experience, customer experience, and revenue growth, delivering personalized coaching, recognition, and motivation to frontline workers based on live feedback. Founded in 2014 in a backyard shed in Auckland, New Zealand by Aaron Ward and John Ballinger, it now serves over 1,300 companies globally with offices in Portland (Oregon), Salt Lake City (Utah), Auckland, and Amsterdam."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
