ech", "matchedCompany": "Fable Food Co", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Fable Food Co is an Australian food-tech company making plant-based meat alternatives crafted primarily from shiitake mushrooms, which make up roughly two-thirds of its ingredient list, with no GMOs, preservatives or artificial ingredients. Its umami-rich, clean-label products (such as braised \\"beef\\") are sold through supermarkets including Woolworths, Coles and Harris Farm Markets, and via foodservice partners like Grill'd and Guzman y Gómez. The company has been endorsed by chef Heston Blumenthal and is expanding internationally from its Australian base. Its mission is to change the way people eat to nourish the world more healthily and sustainably."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
