cription": "Factor is a New Zealand-based SaaS company offering an energy pricing and forecasting toolkit that replaces slow, manual, spreadsheet-based processes with precise, real-time, machine-learning-driven modelling for even the most complex energy contracts. Its platform combines a rich forecast library, reusable charge logic, and full API control, enabling energy retailers and utilities to design, price, and manage commercial electricity propositions at scale and support the energy transition. Founded by former Flick Electric leaders Jessica Venning-Bryan and Simon Pohlen, it raised a NZ$3M seed round led by Icehouse Ventures with backing from Blackbird and K1W1. In May 2026 Factor was acquired by ASX/NZX-listed Gentrack."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
