ry platform; Blackbird Ventures seed-led portfolio company", "totalRaisedUsd": 17800000, "longDescription": "Marqo is an end-to-end vector/tensor search platform that converts unstructured data (text and images) into searchable embeddings, handling embedding generation, storage, and retrieval through a single API for multimodal and multilingual search and retrieval-augmented generation. Founded in 2022 by ex-AWS engineers Tom Hamer and Jesse Clark, the company has since evolved toward an AI-native ecommerce product discovery platform (\\"Commerce Superintelligence\\") that trains brand-specific models on a retailer's catalog and shopper behavior to power search, recommendations, and merchandising. It is backed by Blackbird Ventures (seed lead), Lightspeed, January Capital, and Creator Fund."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
