roader AI) and automatically converts the real projects they complete into authenticated, shareable skill portfolios. Built around \\"the Learning Loop\\" — combining polished UX, personalized content, community support, and trusted skill verification — it positions itself as the verification layer for the AI skills economy, shifting hiring and learning from inferred credentials to proven outcomes. Founded in New Zealand by Amber Joseph and later relocated to Austin, Texas, the platform has grown to roughly 190,000-200,000+ learners across 190+ countries. Long term the company aims to build the world's best learning experience for any subject, from cloud engineering to law and healthcare."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
