eet is a SaaS platform that lets non-technical teams document, automate, track, and optimize recurring processes and workflows. Originally a simple checklist/workflow tool, it has evolved into an AI-powered \\"Compliance Operations Platform\\" connecting policy governance, automated workflow execution, and audit-ready oversight. It serves thousands of customers across finance, healthcare, technology, and government, including companies such as Salesforce, Airbnb, and Spotify. The company was founded in 2014 by two backpackers who met in a hostel in Buenos Aires and operates as a globally distributed team."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
