on": "Propeller Aero is a Sydney-founded company providing a cloud-based platform that combines high-precision drone mapping with 3D reality capture, machine telematics, and field collaboration tools so heavy-civil and resources teams can map, measure, and manage their worksites. Its products (including the AeroPoints GPS surveying targets) let crews track productivity, job progress, and budgets through a unified 3D interface accessible from any device. Founded in 2014, the company has grown globally with offices in Denver, Manila, and Amsterdam, powering tens of thousands of users across worksites in over 100 countries. It is a Blackbird Ventures portfolio company, also backed by Costanoa Ventures, Accel, and Sequoia China."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
