urveys and churn reasons to surface critical product gaps in real time. The product evolved from the founders' earlier ProductKit project into what they describe as the operating system / \\"mission control room\\" for product managers, helping them act on customer insights, track feature iterations and report to stakeholders. Founded in Sydney in 2022 by former product and engineering leaders from Atlassian, SafetyCulture and Eucalyptus, the company is used by product companies including Atlassian, Linktree, Whatnot and Tracksuit."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
