mate builds no-code software for industrial and \\"built world\\" organisations, enabling them to digitise paperwork, forms, workflows and compliance processes without writing code. Its flagship product, Dashpivot, lets teams in construction, energy, mining, manufacturing and maritime build customisable digital forms, electronic documentation and e-signature workflows, paired with a mobile app for site workers. Founded in 2015 as Dashpivot and rebranded to Sitemate in 2018, the company serves over 2,000 customers and has grown to roughly 140-150 staff across offices in Sydney, Melbourne, London, Vancouver and Toronto. It has raised multiple rounds led by Blackbird, including a $27.5M Series A in December 2024."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
