rd Ventures portfolio company, acquired by Fanfix in 2025", "totalRaisedUsd": 7000000, "longDescription": "Sunroom was a subscription-based creator platform built as a safer, women- and non-binary-centered alternative to mainstream social media like Instagram, TikTok and OnlyFans. Creators monetized through monthly subscriptions, tips and in-app reactions, with features such as proprietary \\"SunBlock\\" anti-screenshot technology, human-led content moderation, and reduced fees for Black, Indigenous and Hispanic creators. Founded by ex-Hinge design director Lucy Mort and ex-Bumble marketing director Michelle Battersby, the app launched on iOS in February 2022 and onboarded tens of thousands of creators. It was acquired by creator platform Fanfix in 2025, with creators and content migrating over to Fanfix."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
