e candidate companies below list Blackbird as an investor. Blackbird's public portfolio page (~130 active companies) does not include Patchwork, which is consistent with a written-off investment (Blackbird does not surface written-off names publicly), and LP/aggregator databases (CB Insights, parsers.vc, Premier Alts, Dealroom) are paywalled beyond a partial preview and likewise do not show it. The several well-indexed companies named \\"Patchwork\\" — a UK NHS healthtech staffing platform (Patchwork Health) founded 2016 by Anas Nader and Jing Ouyang, investors led by Praetura/Perwyn; a Y Combinator W24 San Francisco AI team-communication tool by Nikki Shah and Dhruhin Kurli, backed by Eight Capital; a UK group-gifting fintech (Olivia Knight); and a Coinbase-alum blockchain tooling startup — all have documented investor lists with no Blackbird involvement, so none is the match. Consistent with a written-off seed/pre-seed AU/NZ company that left little public footprint, the specific entity could not be confidently identified and most descriptive fields remain unknown."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	Portfolio Company
