Heuros is an Australian cellular-agriculture startup developing the growth factors and culture media needed to grow muscle cells for cultivated (clean) meat without foetal bovine serum (FBS), blood products, genetic modification, recombinant proteins, hormones or antibiotics. Operating primarily as a B2B supplier, it aimed to sell its low-cost, GM-free media to other cultivated-meat companies worldwide while developing its own consumer products. Backed by Blackbird Ventures and the ProVeg Incubator, the company was ultimately written off."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
