org:iv-migratemate	organization	Migrate Mate	Job platform connecting international talent to US visa-sponsoring employers	New York, United States	https://migratemate.co	{"immigration tech","visa sponsorship","job marketplace","HR tech",SaaS,"Icehouse Portfolio"}	\N	{"bio": "Migrate Mate is a US-based job-search platform built for international professionals seeking employers that sponsor US work visas (e.g. H-1B, E-3, TN, OPT, Green Card). It curates currently open visa-sponsoring roles and sponsor contact information into a searchable database, advertising hundreds of thousands of verified listings. The company was co-founded by Mihailo Bozic and Dylan Gibbs after Bozic was repeatedly rejected from US jobs for needing visa sponsorship. It is headquartered in New York and backed by US VC Redbud VC; no link to New Zealand or Icehouse Ventures was found.", "notes": "DISAMBIGUATION: The input assumed a New Zealand, Icehouse Ventures-backed company, but no such company exists. The only real entity matching \\"MigrateMate\\"/\\"Migrate Mate\\" is a US (New York) company at migratemate.co, co-founded by Mihailo Bozic (Serbian heritage, Australia-raised) and Dylan Gibbs, and backed by Redbud VC (US) — not Icehouse Ventures. A site-scoped search of icehouseventures.co.nz returned no MigrateMate listing. Founding year (2023) is inferred from secondary accounts (\\"in less than a year... world's biggest immigrant job board\\"); founder roles (CEO, CTO) are confirmed across Redbud VC, RocketReach, and Himalayas listings. Dylan Gibbs's LinkedIn/prior background remain sparse.", "stage": null, "status": "active", "founded": "2023", "sources": ["https://migratemate.co/", "https://redbud.vc/portfolio/migrate-mate", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/mihailobozic/", "https://www.linkedin.com/company/migratemate/", "https://himalayas.app/@mihailobozic", "https://migratemate.co/blog/what-is-migrate-mate", "https://infixstudio.com/how-two-aussie-mates-built-the-first-job-platform-for-people-chasing-the-american-dream/", "https://www.icehouseventures.co.nz/portfolio"], "website": "https://migratemate.co", "industry": "Immigration / HR tech (job-search SaaS)", "confidence": "high", "verifyNote": "Confirmed the company is a US (New York) firm, both founders are real (Mihailo Bozic = Co-founder & CEO; Dylan Gibbs = Co-founder & CTO — draft only said \\"Co-founder\\", now specified as CTO), and that it is backed by Redbud VC with a Forbes 30 Under 30 mention. Independently confirmed NO Icehouse Ventures / New Zealand connection (site-scoped search of icehouseventures.co.nz found nothing), so icehouseBacked stays unconfirmed/contradicted. Corrected Bozic's bio: he is of Serbian heritage and Australia-raised (UWA), not simply \\"Australian-born\\". Founding year 2023 remains inferred from secondary sources. Raised confidence to high given consistent corroboration across multiple independent sources.", "statusDetail": "Operating; backed by Redbud VC (US). Founder/company featured on Forbes 30 Under 30 (Social Impact).", "verifyVerdict": "corrected", "fundingNotable": "Backed by US VC Redbud VC, which lists Migrate Mate as a portfolio company. No disclosed round size or Icehouse Ventures involvement found.", "icehouseBacked": "unconfirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
