receded by a Series A in Sept 2020 (reported as NZ$8m / US$5.4m) led by Bedrock Capital, with Icehouse Ventures and Pushpay co-founder Chris Heaslip.", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
