scaling commercially. Launched first commercial light-activated corn seed traits in 2025 (with US deployment targeted for the 2026 planting season), began expansion into South America (Brazil/Chile) in December 2025, and signed a multi-year NZ ryegrass/forage partnership with Fonterra (Sept 2025; field trials from 2026, commercial launch targeted 2028).", "verifyVerdict": "confirmed", "fundingNotable": "Raised a US$13.5M Series B in June 2022 (led by OurCrowd; investors included Finistere Ventures, Icehouse Ventures, Rabo Ventures and others), followed by an oversubscribed ~US$8.3M Series B Extension closed on 22 April 2025 (led by Fonterra's Ki Tua Fund, with Azolla Ventures and iSelect Fund). Cumulative total funding is not authoritatively confirmed; third-party databases cite roughly US$26M-32M.", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
