pient of the Callaghan Innovation Arohia Trailblazer Grant.", "verifyVerdict": "confirmed", "fundingNotable": "Raised NZ$500,000 pre-seed (announced April 2021), led by Outset Ventures, with Icehouse Ventures, Sir Stephen Tindall's K1W1 and Rocket Lab; Peter Beck invested via a NZ$15,000 convertible note and took a board seat/observer role. Also a recipient of the Callaghan Innovation Arohia Trailblazer Grant. Third-party trackers (Crunchbase/Tracxn) estimate total funding around NZ$5-6M (approximate, unverified).", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
