nd with plans to expand into the US following its August 2024 raise.", "verifyVerdict": "confirmed", "fundingNotable": "Raised ~A$1.25M (announced August 2024) led by NZ VC Icehouse Ventures via the Brand Fund (a JV with NZ firm Previously Unavailable). Other investors include Timely founder Ryan Baker and Tyro co-founder Peter Haig. Round labelled Seed per Tracxn; primary media did not explicitly name the round.", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
org:iv-onside	organization	Onside	Rural risk software for safety, biosecurity, visitor and contractor management on farms.	Christchurch, New Zealand	https://www.getonside.com	{agritech,biosecurity,"farm safety","visitor management","rural SaaS","Icehouse Portfolio"}	\N	{"bio": "Onside is a New Zealand agritech company providing rural risk-management software covering health and safety, biosecurity, and visitor/contractor management via a digital check-in platform. It was founded in 2015 by Ryan Higgs, Juliet Maclean and Michael Falconer, who conceived the idea while at Synlait Farms in Canterbury. It has expanded into a biosecurity intelligence product (Onside Intelligence) that maps rural networks to predict disease spread, and is used across thousands of properties in New Zealand and Australia. The company was named to the Forbes Asia 100 to Watch 2025 list and was a Deloitte Fast 50 regional winner.", "notes": "Disambiguation: this is the NZ agritech Onside (getonside.com / Onside Technology), not foreign companies of the same name. Icehouse backing confirmed: IV named as a participant in the Oct 2020 NZ$2.5M round (NZ Herald) and listed in Onside's investor set in the Forbes Asia 100 to Watch 2025 profile, plus an Icehouse Ventures portfolio/job-board listing. Founding year 2015 per the About page and Icehouse listing; product/app developed 2016, which some media cite as the founding year.", "stage": "Series A", "status": "active", "founded": "2015", "sources": ["https://www.getonside.com/nz/about-us", "https://www.getonside.com/nz", "https://www.nzherald.co.nz/business/onside-raises-25m-to-allow-farmers-to-set-their-boundaries/LRB4WMGQLRM6B674224QR5F5EI/", "https://nzentrepreneur.co.nz/agri-app-onside-aims-for-america-after-australian-achievements/", "https://jobs.icehouseventures.co.nz/companies/onside-technology-2", "https://www.getonside.com/news-and-media/onside-secures-new-zealand-government-funding-for-biosecurity-management-app", "https://www.deloitte.co