org:iv-conqa	organization	CONQA	Construction quality assurance software replacing paper QA with digital checklists, ITPs and reports	Auckland, New Zealand	https://conqa.com/	{ConTech,"Quality Assurance",SaaS,"Construction Software","Field Management","Icehouse Portfolio"}	\N	{"bio": "CONQA is a New Zealand-founded SaaS platform for construction quality assurance, digitising ITPs, hold points, inspection checklists, lot management and compliance evidence. Site teams capture checklists, photos and inspections to reduce defects, manage risk and support payment claims. Customers include civil/infrastructure contractors, precast concrete manufacturers and commercial builders such as Fulton Hogan, Downer and AE Smith. The company runs offices in New Zealand and Australia, with the CEO relocating to Melbourne to drive Australian expansion.", "notes": "This is the Auckland, NZ construction-QA software company, distinct from any same-named foreign entities. All three founders (Daniel O'Donoghue, Peter Simons, Barney Chunn) and their backgrounds (mechanical engineer / electrical engineer / philosophy-English) are independently confirmed by the Roads & Infrastructure Magazine profile and Punakaiki Fund. Total funding figures vary by source (aggregators cite ~US$1.61M; the 2021 Punakaiki-led bridging round was reported at NZ$2.5M) and are approximate. Founder LinkedIn URLs match by name/title via search results; LinkedIn pages themselves block automated fetch.", "stage": "Seed / bridging round (pre-Series A as of 2021)", "status": "active", "founded": "2015", "sources": ["https://conqa.com/", "https://www.conqa.com/our-story", "https://roadsonline.com.au/the-future-is-now-with-conqa/", "https://punakaikifund.co.nz/conqa-saddles-up-for-post-covid-ride-and-sets-an-eye-on-the-usa/", "https://www.icehouseventures.co.nz/portfolio", "https://jobs.icehouseventures.co.nz/companies/conqa", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/conqa", "https://pitchbook.com/profiles/company/459324-73