": "Seed", "status": "active", "founded": "2023", "sources": ["https://www.ternary.energy/", "https://resources.icehouseventures.co.nz/blog/designed-by-apple-in-california", "https://jobs.icehouseventures.co.nz/companies/ternary-kinetics-2", "https://www.macdiarmid.ac.nz/news-and-events/news/annual-reports-pages/seed-funding-projects-to-give-a-rapid-boost-to-commercial-feasibility-annual-report-2024/", "https://oversightsolutions.co.nz/profile/TERNARY-KINETICS-LIMITED", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Marshall", "https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/kiwi-vc-icehouse-ventures-is-halfway-to-nailing-a-new-30m-seed-fund/", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/ternary-kinetics"], "website": "https://www.ternary.energy/", "industry": "Clean energy / deep tech (hydrogen energy storage)", "confidence": "high", "verifyNote": "Core facts independently confirmed via the company site, Icehouse Ventures' own blog (\\"first third-gen company\\"), MacDiarmid Institute annual report, NZ Companies Office shareholder data, and Wikipedia. Founders (Molloy/CEO, Marshall/CSO, Simpson/Executive Chairman), Icehouse backing (~14.3% via Icehouse Ventures Nominees Ltd), active status, technology, and the \\">NZ$3M in ~18 months\\" raise all check out. Minor refinements: clarified that Marshall (not Molloy) developed the technology and co-founded Zincovery; Peter Beck is listed as \\"Director\\" on the company site though Icehouse's blog calls him \\"Chair\\" (noted both); added Marshall's 2025 Pickering Medal; flagged that Crunchbase's ~US$1.98M is a lower partial figure than the reported >NZ$3M. Sean Molloy and Sean Simpson LinkedIn URLs could not be independently re-fetched (LinkedIn auth-gated/404), and Peter Beck's LinkedIn left null to avoid invention.", "statusDetail": "Active early-stage startup; raised over NZ$3M and building out its team as of 2024-2025. Companies Office data (June 2025) noted ~21 months operating.", "verifyVerdict": "confirmed", "fundingNotable": "Raised over NZ$3M from local and international investors over ~18 months (per MacDiarmid Institute). Investors include Icehouse Ventures (Seed Fund III, an early investor), Outset Ventures (Fund II) and Motion Capital. NZ Companies Office data (via oversightsolutions.co.nz, June 2025) shows shareholdings of Sean Molloy ~40.5%, Aaron Marshall ~15.6%, Icehouse Ventures Nominees Ltd ~14.3%, Outset Ventures Nominees Ltd ~11.7%, Sean Simpson ~6.3%. Crunchbase lists a lower partial total (~US$1.98M).", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
