ion through a single API. Its no-code rules engine, fraud controls and user observability tools let teams customize authentication flows across the customer journey to prevent account takeovers while preserving user experience. Customers include MoneyGram, Qualcomm, Air New Zealand, TradeMe, Hnry and First Credit Union. The company was founded by ex-fintech operators frustrated by the complexity and cost of building authentication in-house."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
