 E", "snappedSector": "Developer Tools", "matchedCompany": "Baseten (Baseten Labs, Inc.) — AI inference infrastructure platform", "totalRaisedUsd": 585000000, "longDescription": "Baseten is a San Francisco-based infrastructure software company that provides a high-scale AI inference platform, helping enterprises deploy and run machine learning models in production without latency, reliability, or cost headaches. Its platform handles the full inference stack — provisioning GPUs across multiple clouds, optimizing model performance, and routing requests to the fastest available compute — and supports both open-source models (Llama, DeepSeek, Whisper) and custom models. Positioned as the \\"AWS for inference,\\" Baseten serves customers including Cursor, Abridge, Notion, Clay, Mercor, and OpenEvidence. The company has raised $585M to date, most recently a $300M Series E at a $5B valuation (January 2026), with reports of a pending round near an $11B valuation."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
