scoop.co.nz/stories/BU2001/S00091/spoke-phone-raises-7-million-to-migrate-legacy-phone-system.htm", "https://www.startupdaily.net/2020/01/office-desk-phone-killer-spoke-phone-just-raised-6-7-million-in-series-a/", "https://www.nzherald.co.nz/business/auckland-startup-spoke-phone-raises-11m-for-its-disruptive-internet-calling-software/5PKMEJVT7J7KWHBGDWQ5CBB7KA/", "https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260506075516/en/Spoke-Unveils-Brand-Evolution-and-Launches-Industrys-First-Automated-Call-QA-for-Mobile-Phones-at-Twilio-SIGNAL-2026", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/spoke-phone", "https://www.crunchbase.com/person/kieron-lawson", "https://theorg.com/org/spoke-phone/org-chart/jason-kerr"], "website": "https://www.getspoke.com", "industry": "B2B SaaS / Business communications (cloud telephony / VoIP)", "confidence": "high", "verifyNote": "Independently confirmed all material claims: both founders (Jason Kerr CEO, Kieron Lawson CTO) with their roles and backgrounds; active status; the May 2026 brand evolution to \\"Spoke\\" and Spoke Enlighten launch at Twilio SIGNAL 2026; ~5M conversations/week across ~2,300 customers; and Icehouse Ventures backing (named investor in the Jan 2020 Series A and \\"Spoke\\" listed on the Icehouse portfolio page). Only correction: updated the primary website to https://www.getspoke.com, the post-rebrand domain (spokephone.com remains live as a legacy property). Funding figures left as approximate ranges since sources/currencies differ.", "statusDetail": "Active as of May 2026; announced a brand evolution to \\"Spoke\\" and launched Spoke Enlighten (automated call QA/coaching for mobile phones) at Twilio SIGNAL San Francisco 2026.", "verifyVerdict": "confirmed", "fundingNotable": "Raised a Series A announced January 2020 (reported variously as ~US$4.5M / A$6.7M / NZ$7M), led by Australian VC Marbruck Investments with participation from Icehouse Ventures and Sir Stephen Tindall's K1W1; total reported funding around US$5.8M (figures vary by source and currency).", "icehouseBacked": "confirmed"}	community:icehouse-ventures	\N	2026-05-31 08:57:29.572	2026-06-01 01:42:36.222	Startup
