ocurement software for small and medium procurement teams in regulated industries such as government, banking, healthcare, utilities and primary industries. Its workflow platform lets teams design, manage, evaluate and audit procurement processes from planning and tendering through to contract and supplier relationship management, replacing fragmented Excel/Office-based workflows. The product has since evolved into a \\"procurement context layer\\" that turns unstructured data like emails, invoices, meetings and contracts into queryable intelligence alongside existing systems such as Coupa, Ariba and ERPs. Cotiss is SOC 2 Type II certified and counts government and enterprise customers in New Zealand and Australia."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
