atchedCompany": "Fleet Space Technologies", "totalRaisedUsd": 165000000, "longDescription": "Fleet Space Technologies is an Adelaide-based space company that combines low-cost nanosatellites, ground-based seismic edge sensors, and AI-driven analytics to deliver decision-ready subsurface data. Its flagship ExoSphere platform produces real-time, high-resolution 3D imaging of the Earth's subsurface to accelerate critical mineral exploration for mining companies. Originally founded to provide global IoT connectivity via a constellation of small satellites, the company has pivoted toward space-enabled geoscience and exploration, and is also pursuing planetary science and defence applications."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
