ngStage": "Seed", "snappedSector": "Consumer & Marketplace", "matchedCompany": "Kiki (formerly EasyRent / Kiki.nyc / Kiki Club) — peer-to-peer subletting club, Blackbird Ventures portfolio", "totalRaisedUsd": 6000000, "longDescription": "Kiki (originally launched as EasyRent in New Zealand) is a peer-to-peer, invite-only subletting club that connects people to sublet their rental homes during extended trips, focused on short-term stays of one to three months. It uses social ties and affinity-based matching similar to a dating app — often described as \\"Hinge meets Airbnb\\" — to build trust between listers and renters, and offers deposit protection, tenant vetting, and payment handling. After launching and closing in Auckland and Sydney and then shutting its controversial New York operation in 2025, the company relocated to London, where it currently operates. It is a Blackbird Ventures portfolio company, which led its 2023 seed round."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
