d Ventures portfolio listing for a company named \\"Lucy\\"/\\"Lucy AI\\" or for Curious Thing could be independently confirmed; Curious Thing's documented investors are Reinventure, Qualgro, Hawkstone, Black Sheep Capital and January Capital, so the Blackbird connection to this specific entity remains unverified."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
