ny": "Tracksuit (gotracksuit.com) — Auckland, NZ-founded brand tracking SaaS platform", "totalRaisedUsd": 43000000, "longDescription": "Tracksuit is a brand-tracking SaaS platform that gives marketers always-on, affordable insights into brand health metrics such as awareness, consideration, usage, preference and perception. It surveys real consumers continuously (over a million data points weekly) and presents benchmarked findings against competitors through accessible dashboards, positioned as roughly 10x cheaper than traditional brand-tracking research. Founded in Auckland in 2021, it has scaled to serve more than 1,000 brand customers across markets including New Zealand, Australia, the US, UK, Canada and parts of Europe."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
