any": "Nura (nuraphone / Nura Operations Pty Ltd) — Melbourne personalized-audio headphones company, acquired by Denon/Masimo in 2023", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Nura is a Melbourne-founded consumer-audio company that designs headphones and earbuds with proprietary personalised-sound technology, automatically measuring a listener's hearing sensitivity across frequencies (via otoacoustic emissions from the inner ear) and tailoring audio output to their unique hearing profile. The startup gained early prominence with a 2016 Kickstarter campaign that raised about US$1.8M from 7,730 backers — the largest Australian Kickstarter campaign at the time — and went on to ship products including the nuraphone, NuraLoop, and NuraTrue earbuds. Backed by Blackbird Ventures across seed and Series A rounds, Nura was acquired in 2023 by Denon, part of Masimo Corporation, which integrated its personalised-audio technology and subsequently discontinued the Nura-branded product line."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
