va in April 2026.", "totalRaisedUsd": 35000000, "longDescription": "Ortto (formerly Autopilot) is a customer data and marketing automation platform that unifies customer data, AI-powered automation/journeys, and analytics in one place, with channels including email, SMS, push, live chat, and a knowledge base. Founded in Sydney by brothers Michael and Chris Sharkey, it began as the Autopilot visual journey builder (launched 2015), was rebuilt from the ground up after the founders returned to Australia in 2018, and rebranded to Ortto in March 2022. It served more than 11,000 customers across 190+ countries (including LiveChat, Atlassian, and Patreon) before being acquired by Canva in April 2026. The Sharkey brothers joined Canva in leadership roles across its AI and marketing technology teams."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
