 2018 by Alice Williams after her own struggle with endometriosis and debilitating period pain. Its flagship product is a small, discreet wearable TENS/pulse-therapy device that delivers electrical pulses to the abdomen to stop period pain instantly without drugs, designed for the ~88% of women who experience painful menstruation. The company has since expanded into women's-health supplements and built a large direct-to-consumer and social-media following across Australia, the US, Canada and the UK. Backed by Blackbird Ventures, Ovira is listed as an exited company in Blackbird's portfolio."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
