rs, optimizing static assets (JPEG, GIF, PNG, SVG, JS, CSS) in real time via image optimization and CSS/JavaScript minification. It marketed itself as making ecommerce websites load 30-60% faster without breaking the site, improving conversion and revenue while lowering bandwidth and running costs. The company went through Start-Up Chile and built a significant presence in Latin America (with offices/operations in Santiago, Chile), serving large ecommerce retailers including Falabella.com, one of Latin America's largest multinational retailers. Pageload raised an A$300,000 seed round from Blackbird Ventures in 2015 but has since ceased operations (operating status: closed/shutdown)."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
