nappedSector": "Healthtech", "matchedCompany": "See-Mode Technologies Pte. Ltd.", "totalRaisedUsd": 8000000, "longDescription": "See-Mode Technologies builds AI software that automatically analyzes ultrasound images to produce fast, accurate, standardized radiology reports. Originally founded to predict and prevent strokes using computer vision and computational fluid dynamics (its first product AVA automated vascular reporting), the company expanded into FDA-cleared tools that detect and characterize thyroid nodules (TI-RADS) and breast lesions (BI-RADS). Its technology has been shown to reduce ultrasound scan and reporting time by up to 30%. The company was acquired by RadNet (via its DeepHealth subsidiary) in June 2025."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
