": 1700000, "longDescription": "Shape Analytics (branded \\"Shape\\") built a people analytics platform that brought together employee data from disparate sources across an organization and delivered comprehensive reporting, insights, and predictions without requiring a dedicated data science team. Founded in 2015 by Tuhin Srivastava and Philip Howes, it was backed by Blackbird Ventures, Lowercase Capital, and Caffeinated Capital, raising roughly $1.7M. In June 2018 it was acquired by performance-management company Reflektive, where its technology was integrated as \\"Reflektive Analytics.\\" The founders later went on to co-found AI infrastructure company Baseten in 2019."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
