primitive that turns LLMs from search engines into decision-making partners. It is an early-stage, largely stealth venture led by co-CEOs Chris Bach (Netlify co-founder) and Alex Pan (Storipress founder, Forbes 30 Under 30), with CTO Athon Millane and PhD researchers in time-series (Ming Jin, Griffith University) and graph methods (Andy Huang, Oxford). The founding team is Australian-rooted and based in Sydney, and the company is backed by Blackbird Ventures."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
