ning knitting and crochet patterns accessible to anyone, no design skills required. Its proprietary \\"pattern engine\\" let users pick a base, silhouette, size, yarn and embellishments to instantly generate an original sweater or beanie pattern with interactive instructions, row counters and stitch checkpoints — eliminating the 50+ hours an experienced designer normally spends per pattern. The app launched in February 2020 and grew rapidly during COVID-19 lockdowns, reaching 60,000+ Apple downloads (about 80% in North America) and 115,000+ user-created designs by June 2020. The company was later wound down and is listed as written off / deadpooled."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
