onomous retail / spatial-AI startup backed by Blackbird Ventures", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Black.ai built an autonomous retail platform that mapped and monitored physical stores in real time using a small number of discreet ceiling-mounted 3D depth sensors. The system maintained a virtual \\"cart\\" for each shopper, detecting product pickup and put-down events (even for visually similar fresh produce) to reduce self-checkout loss and surface in-store customer insights. The company positioned itself more broadly as an AI startup focused on automation in real spaces, with applications extending into healthcare and mining (monitoring patient vital signs and tracking staff and heavy machinery). Backed by Blackbird Ventures, the company is recorded as Written Off in Blackbird's portfolio."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
