Tools", "matchedCompany": "Carted (Australian universal commerce API / shopping wishlist startup, founded by Holly Cardew & Mike Angell, Blackbird-backed)", "totalRaisedUsd": 10000000, "longDescription": "Carted built a \\"universal commerce API\\" that let developers, creators and content platforms connect to millions of merchants and billions of products through a single integration, enabling direct, in-context checkout instead of clunky redirects and affiliate links. It later pivoted toward a consumer \\"ultimate wishlist\\" shopping app that let shoppers save products from across the web and get notified when items went on sale or were restocked. Backed by one of Australia's largest-ever seed rounds (A$13M in 2021, led by Blackbird), the company struggled to reach scale as social platforms added native commerce and AI/agentic shopping reshaped the market. Carted wound down operations on 22 October 2025."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
