and deep-tech startup developing a novel gravity-based, medium and long-duration energy storage system for the offshore wind and renewables market. Its technology stores energy by raising and lowering multiple thousand-tonne masses (iron-ore aggregate) between the ocean floor and surface over vertical distances of 4-8km, connected to the grid via undersea cable. The company positioned this as a lower-cost, more scalable and more environmentally friendly alternative to pumped-hydro and lithium-ion batteries, requiring no land and carrying minimal accident risk. Blackbird led an oversubscribed seed round in 2021."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
