nts pass back to investors an agreed portion of the resulting increase in income-tax revenue for a set period, meaning training is free for participants and costless upfront for governments. The mechanism was invented by founder Dr. Nat Ware during his PhD on education finance at Oxford, and Forte has run programs in markets including Australia, Colombia, Costa Rica and Puerto Rico."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
