vely Healthcare in 2021", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Honee was a Melbourne-based discovery, booking and engagement platform for the beauty, wellness and fitness industry, offering salons an end-to-end online booking service, payments and a digital storefront. It was founded on the insight that the vast majority of Australian salons had no online presence and almost all appointments were still booked over the phone — at its peak Honee listed over 10,000 venues and 200,000 services across Sydney and Melbourne. The startup raised a $1.8M seed round led by Blackbird Ventures in 2018 after coming through the Startmate accelerator. It was acquired by health-tech company Vively Healthcare in August 2021 for an undisclosed amount, and Blackbird carries the investment as written off."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
