. Blackbird Ventures' exposure traces to its early backing of Dgraph Labs (an investor from Dgraph's 2016 seed onward), which merged into Hypermode in 2023."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
