ocs.com) — Brisbane, Australia export/trade documentation SaaS, founded by Brandon Boor, Ben Thompson & David Hooper; Blackbird Ventures portfolio company", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "IncoDocs is a SaaS platform that lets small and medium enterprises easily create compliant international trade and shipping documentation and share that information digitally with the many parties involved in a shipment. Founded in 2016 by importers/exporters who built the tool to solve their own trading company's documentation pain, it has been used by tens of thousands of businesses across 120+ countries. In 2019 it raised a $1.2M seed round led by global shipping giant Maersk (via Maersk Growth), with Blackbird Ventures and Transition Level Investments participating, alongside an audience-driven content business (newsletter of 150,000+ subscribers, courses, and trade tools). Blackbird classifies the holding as Written Off, though the company continues to operate its website and products."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
