nformation — maintenance histories, equipment inventories and warranty details — in a comprehensive digital logbook. It aimed to be the \\"single source of record\\" for the marine industry, connecting boat owners with technicians, builders and insurers, and later leveraged AI and intelligent automation to address gaps in vessel maintenance. Backed by Blackbird Ventures, the company struggled to find product-market fit because incentives across owners, technicians, buyers and insurers did not align to create the network effect needed. After roughly 20 months and several pivots, co-founder/CTO Sahan Dissanayake stepped away (with CEO Sean Thompson continuing part-time), and Blackbird records the investment as written off."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
org:voqo	organization	Voqo	Voice AI agents that answer and triage inbound calls for real estate and property teams	Sydney, Australia	https://www.voqo.ai	{"AI & ML","Written Off","Blackbird Portfolio","Artificial Intelligence","Voice AI"}	\N	{"kind": "portfolio_company", "sector": "Real Estate Technology (Proptech)", "status": "Written Off", "twitter": null, "website": "https://www.voqo.ai", "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/voqo-ai", "research": {"sources": ["https://www.blackbird.vc/portfolio/voqo-ai", "https://www.voqo.ai/blog/the-future-is-agentic-announcing-voqo-ai-s-pre-seed-round-led-by-blackbird-ventures", "https://www.voqo.ai/about", "https://unswfounders.com/our-startups/voqoai", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/voqo-ai", "https://pitchbook.com/profiles/company/898195-42", "https://boqian-ma.github.io/", "https://www.realestatetodayaustralia.com.au/post/voqo-ai-raises-800k-to-answer-every-call-the-industry-keeps-missing", "https://au.linkedin.com/in/drekim", "https://au.linkedin.com/in/amith-jacob-kovoor"], "confidence": "medium", "researchedAt": "2026-05-31", "missingFields": ["totalRaisedUsd", "twitter", "logoUrl", "exitDetails.year", "exitDetails.amount"]}, "hqCountry": "Australia", "crunchbase": "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/voqo-ai", "subSectors": ["Artificial Intelligence", "Voice AI", "Conversational AI", "Property Management Software", "SaaS"], "exitDetails": {"type": "Shutdown", "year": null, "amount": null, "ticker": null, "acquirer": null}, "foundedYear": 2024, "statusGroup": "written-off", "totalRaised": "$800K", "fundingStage": "Pre-Seed", "snappedSector": "AI & ML", "matchedCompany": "Voqo AI (formerly Heffron AI)", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Voqo AI is a Sydney-based proptech startup building voice AI agents that answer inbound calls on behalf of real estate professionals 24/7, using company-trained data. The system picks up missed calls (e.g. an after-hours tenant maintenance issue or a buyer enquiry during an open home), understands the request, captures leads and structured call summaries, and updates CRMs via integrations with platforms like Domain and REA. It serves property managers (after-hours maintenance, tenant enquiries, admin) and sales agents (lead, appraisal and buyer capture while on the road). The company raised a pre-seed round led by Blackbird Ventures and is listed as Written Off in Blackbird's portfolio."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
org:wern-sen-wong	organization	Wern Sen Wong	AI-powered, zero-effort loyalty and rewards network built on consumer open-banking data.	20 Symonds Street, Auckland 1010, New Zealand	https://www.joingrapevine.com/	{Fintech,"Written Off","Blackbird Portfolio","Open Banking","Loyalty & Rewards"}	\N	{"kind": "portfolio_company", "sector": "Financial Technology", "status": "Written Off", "twitter": null, "website": "https://www.joingrapevine.com/", "linkedin": "https://nz.linkedin.com/company/supaloyal", "research": {"sources": ["https://www.blackbird.vc/portfolio/supaloyal", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/wernsen-wong-b16639100/", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jiaoxie/", "https://nz.linkedin.com/in/ianshanewong", "https://nz.linkedin.com/company/supaloyal", "https://nz.linkedin.com/company/joingrapevine", "https://www.nbr.co.nz/tech/startup-uses-transactional-data-to-tackle-cost-of-living-crisis/", "https://www.scoop.co.nz/stories/BU2308/S00289/5000-auckland-students-are-using-ai-to-beat-the-high-cost-of-feeding-themselves.htm", "https://www.joingrapevine.com/"], "confidence": "medium", "researchedAt": "2026-05-31", "missingFields": ["totalRaised", "totalRaisedUsd", "crunchbase", "twitter", "logoUrl", "exitDetails.year", "exitDetails.amount"]}, "hqCountry": "New Zealand", "crunchbase": null, "subSectors": ["Open Banking", "Loyalty & Rewards", "Consumer FinTech", "Retail Tech", "Artificial Intelligence"], "exitDetails": {"type": "Shutdown", "year": null, "amount": null, "ticker": null, "acquirer": null}, "foundedYear": 2021, "statusGroup": "written-off", "totalRaised": null, "fundingStage": "Seed", "snappedSector": "Fintech", "matchedCompany": "Grapevine (rebranded SupaLoyal) — \\"Wern Sen Wong\\" is co-founder Wernsen Wong", "totalRaisedUsd": null, "longDescription": "Grapevine (later rebranded SupaLoyal) is an Auckland, New Zealand startup co-founded in 2021 by Jiao Xie, Wernsen Wong, and Ian Shane Wong. It began as a student-focused food savings and rewards app that securely analyzed users' anonymized bank transaction data to predict spending preferences and automatically unlock discounts and cashback at partner outlets, reaching roughly 5,000 university students across two Auckland universities and 100+ local food merchants. It later pivoted/rebranded to SupaLoyal, billed as the \\"world's first AI-powered, zero-effort loyalty network,\\" which uses consumer open-banking data so users earn 5–15% automatic cashback on every transaction (pitched as \\"10x better than bank cards\\") while merchants acquire and retain customers via AI-driven marketing. The company went through the Startmate accelerator in 2021 and was backed by Blackbird (invested 2021) and Phase One Ventures. Blackbird classifies the investment as Written Off, and the two technical co-founders (Wernsen Wong and Ian Shane Wong) have since moved to Heidi Health, where Wernsen is a Senior AI Engineer and Ian is VP of Engineering. The consumer site remains at joingrapevine.com."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
org:wow-such-business	organization	Wow Such Business	Dogecoin micropayment tipping service (dogetipbot) for Reddit, Twitter and Twitch	Arcata, United States	https://wowsuchbusiness.com	{Fintech,"Written Off","Blackbird Portfolio","Digital currency micropayments","Cryptocurrency tipping"}	\N	{"kind": "portfolio_company", "sector": "Cryptocurrency / Fintech", "status": "Written Off", "twitter": null, "website": "https://wowsuchbusiness.com", "linkedin": null, "research": {"sources": ["https://blackbird.vc/portfolio/wow-such-business/", "https://www.cbinsights.com/company/wow-such-business", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/dogetipbot", "https://tracxn.com/d/companies/dogetipbot/__b0sRHE8QxMi7WJta_vAKyrXyAMgnXEwYY0O_Bry0jX0", "https://gizmodo.com/reddit-users-lose-real-money-after-meme-currency-bot-di-1795125165", "https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2017/04/09/the-dark-days-of-dogecoin-how-scammers-and-bandits-brought-down-cryptos-friendliest-currency/amp/", "https://www.financemagnates.com/cryptocurrency/news/dogetipbot-gets-445k-investment-to-grow-audience-and-improve-user-experience/", "https://www.livebitcoinnews.com/dogetipbot-forced-shut-due-lack-operational-funds/", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohland/", "https://github.com/mohland"], "confidence": "high", "researchedAt": "2026-05-31", "missingFields": ["linkedin", "twitter", "logoUrl", "exitDetails.amount", "founders[0].website", "founders[1].linkedinUrl", "founders[1].twitterUrl", "founders[1].location", "founders[1].website"]}, "hqCountry": "United States", "crunchbase": "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/dogetipbot", "subSectors": ["Digital currency micropayments", "Cryptocurrency tipping", "Dogecoin", "Payments"], "exitDetails": {"type": "Shutdown", "year": 2017, "amount": null, "ticker": null, "acquirer": null}, "foundedYear": 2014, "statusGroup": "written-off", "totalRaised": "$480K", "fundingStage": "Seed", "snappedSector": "Fintech", "matchedCompany": "Wow Such Business Inc. (creators of dogetipbot)", "totalRaisedUsd": 480000, "longDescription": "Wow Such Business Inc. was the company built around dogetipbot, a bot that let people send Dogecoin microtransaction tips to each other on Reddit, Twitter and Twitch. Founded around 2013-2014 in Arcata, California by Josh Mohland (with co-founder David Dvorak), it became the most popular cryptocurrency tipping service on the internet during Dogecoin's early peak, processing over 650,000 transactions. The business failed to raise follow-on funding; in May 2017 Mohland declared personal Chapter 7 bankruptcy, shut down the service, and zeroed out all users' Dogecoin balances after the hot wallet was drained. The investment was a write-off for Blackbird Ventures."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
org:zova	organization	Zova	Female-focused fitness app with music-paced, science-backed workouts for iPhone, Apple Watch and Apple TV.	Sydney, Australia	https://zova.com	{Healthtech,"Written Off","Blackbird Portfolio","Fitness App","Consumer Mobile App"}	\N	{"kind": "portfolio_company", "sector": "Health & Fitness", "status": "Written Off", "twitter": "https://x.com/zovaapp", "website": "https://zova.com", "linkedin": "https://au.linkedin.com/company/zova", "research": {"sources": ["https://www.blackbird.vc/portfolio/zova", "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/zova", "https://www.crunchbase.com/funding_round/zova-seed--360be3c9", "https://tracxn.com/d/companies/zova/__7uF9rnG3bS1Sg0bP3V5HNep7iHDArbPt4GVtJcwugHc", "https://www.startupdaily.net/advice/zova-aims-change-way-women-work-investors-buying/", "https://www.smartcompany.com.au/startupsmart/fitness-app-zova-gets-smart-about-health-tech-with-ios-launch/", "https://au.linkedin.com/in/niallmccarthy86", "https://www.jamestonkin.com/", "https://au.linkedin.com/in/james-tonkin-a1553315", "https://x.com/jamesptonkin", "https://medium.com/@Zova/big-things-are-happening-to-zova-heres-what-you-need-to-do-d89e94af656e"], "confidence": "medium", "researchedAt": "2026-05-31", "missingFields": ["logoUrl", "exitDetails.year", "exitDetails.amount"]}, "hqCountry": "Australia", "crunchbase": "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/zova", "subSectors": ["Fitness App", "Consumer Mobile App", "Digital Health", "Wellness", "HealthTech"], "exitDetails": {"type": "Shutdown", "year": null, "amount": null, "ticker": null, "acquirer": null}, "foundedYear": 2013, "statusGroup": "written-off", "totalRaised": "$939K", "fundingStage": "Seed", "snappedSector": "Healthtech", "matchedCompany": "Zova (zova.com) — female-focused fitness/workout app, Sydney/Brisbane, Australia; Blackbird Ventures seed investment (2015)", "totalRaisedUsd": 939319, "longDescription": "Zova was an Australian consumer fitness app aimed primarily at women, combining custom-made music, guided rhythm and exercise science to deliver personalized workouts across cardio, HIIT, strength, circuit, flexibility and yoga. The app was contextually smart, recommending workouts based on factors like time of day, location and lifestyle, and integrated with Apple Health on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple TV. It won an Apple Design Award and was featured as an App Store Editors' Choice. Backed by Blackbird Ventures in a 2015 seed round, the company was ultimately written off by the fund; founders Niall McCarthy and James Tonkin later moved on to a new fitness venture, Newie."}	community:blackbird-ventures	\N	2026-06-01 01:42:34.43	2026-06-01 01:44:40.738	Portfolio Company
